    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i was just working in my yard and stepped on a piece of old rusty metal, i think it was a tool or something. it's a pretty deep puncture in my heel and it's bleeding a bit but it doesnt really hurt that bad right now. i cant really afford a doctor visit or missing more work this week so i just want to handle it myself. what is the best way to deep clean it and maybe seal it up with something at home so i dont have to worry about it getting infected?",
